{"book":"3john","num":1,"verses":[{"en":"The elder unto the wellbeloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth.","n":1,"sm":"Kaio, o le pele, o le ou te alofa faamaoni i ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Kaio,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"pele,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaoni"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai."}]},{"en":"Beloved, I wish above all things that thou mayest prosper and be in health, even as thy soul prospereth.","n":2,"sm":"Le pele e, ia e manuia i mea uma, ma ia e malolo, faapei ona manuia o lou agaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"pele"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"manuia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"uma,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"malolo,"},{"en":"","sm":"faapei"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"manuia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"agaga."}]},{"en":"For I rejoiced greatly, when the brethren came and testified of the truth that is in thee, even as thou walkest in the truth.","n":3,"sm":"Auā ua tele lava loʻu fiafia ina ua o mai le au uso, ma faailoa mai lou faamaoni, ina ua e savali i le upu moni.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Auā"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tele"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"fiafia"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"uso,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"faailoa"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaoni,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"savali"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"moni."}]},{"en":"I have no greater joy than to hear that my children walk in truth.","n":4,"sm":"E leai so'u 6a6a e sili i lenei, pe a ou faal