sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"Wherefore, if I come, I will remember his deeds which he doeth, prating against us with malicious words: and not content therewith, neither doth he himself receive the brethren, and forbiddeth them that would, and casteth them out of the church.","n":10,"sm":"O le mea lea, pe a au alu atu, ou te faamanatu ai lana amio o loo faia e ia, o loo tuaupua mai ia i matou i upu leaga; e le gata foi i ia mea, a e le talia lava e ia le au uso, E vavao atu foi i e loto iai, na te faateaina foi i latou i le ekalesia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"lea,"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faamanatu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"tuaupua"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"gata"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"mea,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"talia"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"uso,"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"vavao"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"loto"},{"en":"","sm":"iai,"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faateaina"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ekalesia."}]},{"en":"Beloved, follow not that which is evil, but that which is good. He that doeth good is of God: but he that doeth evil 